<title>UK: LME markets stay slow in PM, most end stable.</title>
<headline>LME markets stay slow in PM, most end stable.</headline>
<text>
<p>LEAD - Closes firm, near three-month highs</p>
<p>COPPER - Finishes little-changed, market slow.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Ends stable, holds $1,600.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ends steadier, around highs.</p>
<p>ZINC - Cuts losses by close, still correcting.</p>
<p>TIN -Closes quiet, slightly higher. ALLOY - Slow.</p>
</text>
